abstract: >-
  Code, protocols, raw results and verifiers for PCI_T (a perturbational
  complexity index for transformers and its directional specificity) and
  FCA-Bench (a functional causal access benchmark with behavioral and causal
  profiles), applied to Qwen3-8B. Code under MIT; data, results and
  documentation under CC BY 4.0.
